Body Double is a 1984 American neo-noir erotic thriller film
directed, co-written, and produced by Brian De Palma.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
It stars Craig Wasson, Gregg Henry, Melanie Griffith, and Deborah Shelton.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film is a direct homage to the 1950s films of Alfred Hitchcock, specifically Rear Window, Vertigo, and Dial M for
Murder, taking plot lines and themes (such as voyeurism, panic attack and obsession) from the first two.

15
